## Why This Is Asked
This question tests the ability to design a time-aware, multi-sink Kafka workflow with correct offset handling and idempotence when routing late-arriving data.

## Key Concepts
- EventTime versus wall-clock time
- Late-arrival detection with separate sink routing
- Global idempotence across multiple sinks
- Offset commit semantics in multi-path processing
- Canary test design for on-time versus late events

## Code Example
